---
---
<section id="about" class="bg-cream py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    
    <!-- Editorial Intro & Vision Statement -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mb-24 lg:mb-32" data-reveal="fade-up">
      <span class="font-mono text-primary text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold block mb-8">
        The Al Sahra Philosophy
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[56px] xl:text-[64px] leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-ink mb-12">
        "An individually tailored, one-stop package backed by responsible operations and innovative engineering."
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-16">
        <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Al Sahra Tents & Sheds Fix was established in Sharjah with a single purpose — to deliver reliable sales, manufacturing, and service support in the field of tents and shade systems across the UAE.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-lg leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-6">
          <strong class="text-ink block mb-2 font-display text-xl">Our Vision</strong>
          To set a high standard for quality shade and tensile structure solutions in the UAE. To be recognized for dependable service, technical strength, thoughtful execution, and enduring client value through innovation, trust, and consistency.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- What We Do: Editorial Staggered Layout -->
    <div class="relative pt-16 border-t border-hairline">
      <div class="mb-20 text-center" data-reveal="fade-up">
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink">
          Designed, Forged & Fabricated
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-soft mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Our end-to-end specialized execution process.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-24 lg:gap-32">
        
        <!-- Step 01: Design -->
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center group" data-reveal="fade-up">
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-2 lg:order-1 relative">
            <!-- Large Watermark Number -->
            <div class="absolute -top-16 -left-10 font-display font-black text-[140px] lg:text-[180px] leading-none text-navy-darker/5 select-none pointer-events-none group-hover:text-gold-accent/10 transition-colors duration-500 hidden sm:block">01</div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <span class="text-gold-accent font-mono font-bold text-lg mb-2 block sm:hidden">01</span>
              <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink mb-6">Technical Design Support</h4>
              <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Every product is individually designed to suit the client and the site conditions. We draw on years of specialized technical experience to provide comprehensive structural calculations, material selections, and 3D modeling.
              </p>
              <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-gold-accent"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 order-1 lg:order-2">
            <div class="rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-navy-darker aspect-[16/10] relative lg:group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-700">
               <img src="/images/about_main.png" alt="Engineering Design" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 02: Manufacture -->
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center group" data-reveal="fade-up">
          <div class="lg:col-span-7">
            <div class="rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-navy-darker aspect-[16/10] relative lg:group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-700">
               <img src="/images/inhouse_factory.png" alt="In-House Manufacturing Facility" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500" loading="lazy" />
               <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 sm:bottom-6 sm:left-6 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink shadow-lg">
                 Sharjah Al Dhaid Factory
               </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative lg:pl-10">
            <!-- Large Watermark Number -->
            <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-10 lg:left-0 font-display font-black text-[140px] lg:text-[180px] leading-none text-navy-darker/5 select-none pointer-events-none group-hover:text-primary/10 transition-colors duration-500 hidden sm:block">02</div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <span class="text-primary font-mono font-bold text-lg mb-2 block sm:hidden">02</span>
              <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink mb-6">In-House Manufacturing</h4>
              <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Fabric and steel works are forged and fabricated in our full-fledged Sharjah Al Dhaid facility. By keeping manufacturing in-house, we adhere to strict project specifications and international tensile standards without compromise.
              </p>
              <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-primary"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 03: Install -->
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center group" data-reveal="fade-up">
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-2 lg:order-1 relative">
            <!-- Large Watermark Number -->
            <div class="absolute -top-16 -left-10 font-display font-black text-[140px] lg:text-[180px] leading-none text-navy-darker/5 select-none pointer-events-none group-hover:text-ink/10 transition-colors duration-500 hidden sm:block">03</div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <span class="text-ink font-mono font-bold text-lg mb-2 block sm:hidden">03</span>
              <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink mb-6">Installation & After-Care</h4>
              <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Skilled supervisors and certified installation crews handle site erection across the 7 Emirates. We provide ongoing maintenance support, ensuring no operational requirement goes unheeded long after the project is delivered.
              </p>
              <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-ink"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 order-1 lg:order-2">
            <div class="rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-navy-darker aspect-[16/10] relative lg:group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-700">
               <img src="/images/gallery_tensile_overview_1.png" alt="Site Installation" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
